      "bio": "I am the CEO of Adeeb Technology Lab. I'm a developer, graphic designer, video editor and cybersecurity expert, and I have been working in technology for almost eight years.\n\nI have worked with organisations including IUB, AndroidBull, Raham TV and GCT Bahawalpur. Today our team designs and builds mobile apps for colleges, media brands and businesses, from the first idea to the store launch and beyond.",
